Dear RT Folks,

I'm pleased to announce the 3.2.78-rt113 stable release.


This release is just an update to the new stable 3.2.78 version
and no RT specific changes have been made.


You can get this release via the git tree at:

  git://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/rt/linux-stable-rt.git

  branch: v3.2-rt
  Head SHA1: d697e6288aa38097b6bf0f990dc0b262b2158641


Or to build 3.2.78-rt113 directly, the following patches should be applied:

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/linux-3.2.tar.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/v3.x/patch-3.2.78.xz

  http://www.kernel.org/pub/linux/kernel/projects/rt/3.2/patch-3.2.78-rt113.patch.xz




Enjoy,

-- Steve

